$A6E8 ; its flags
$A6E9 ; back to the cell under the door
$A6EA ; its right neighbour
$A6EB ; its flags: A = the four cells' bits ORed
$A6EE ; a robot or building in the way: the menu stays shut
$A6F7 ; +$06 = 5 steps on that course
$A710 ; key I held?
$A712 ; abandon: Start, the start-up menu again
$A69A ; the controls; the pause while key 1 is held
$A69D ; the ship (unless a robot is under direct control)
