$A6F3 ; the new robot's start state
$A6FB ; order 0: stop and defend
$A6FF ; strength 100 %
$A703 ; +$0F = 1: its first step at once
$A707 ; recount the robots of both sides
$A70A ; reprint the status values
$A70D CheckGameKeys ; Input bit 6 (key I): abandon the game
$A715 ; the next turn (NE tested the save key here)
$A718 SaveCallRemoved ; eight NOPs, NE's save call and EnterPlay jump: never run

$A720 ; IX = the robot record (from FindRobot)
$A724 ; +$0A = 1: the player sits on it; the robot stops (UpdateRobot skips it)
$A728 ; MenuCursor = 4: LEAVE ROBOT highlighted first
$A72D ; $FD39 = 1: the panel shows the menu, UpdateStatusPanel keeps off it

$A732 c RobotMenuShow ; Robot menu: draw the four items, the current order and the strength, then choose
> Clears the side panel (ClearPanel) and prints DIRECT CONTROL, GIVE ORDERS, COMBAT MODE, LEAVE ROBOT at (4,23), every 3 rows, attribute $4D, and the title -ORDERS- at (17,23). Falls into ShowOrder, ShowOrderMiles and RobotMenuChoose. Every submenu comes back here when it is done ($A93E, $AA09, $AACC, $ABFD, the combat menu at $AC8B).
