$A95F ; Z: the robot is gone, return at once
$A965 ; no fire: the next turn
$A96B ; the beep of a choice
$A96D ; beep
$A970 ; back to the menu that called it
$A941 ; +$0A = 2: the robot follows Input
$A949 ; the fire that chose the item must go first
$A94C DirectControlLoop ; a game turn with the robot driven
$A952 ; the ship's radar blink
