$AEB7 t WonText ; " INSIGNIANS DESTROYED ", "   CONGRATULATIONS!   " at (22,0), attribute $45
> The PrintInline string of a won game, over the radar rows. The second line reads CONGRATULATIONS! (NE: YOU HAVE WON !), centred in the same 22 characters.
$AEB7 ; AT (22,0) in $45 (cyan), over the radar: the won game's first line
$AED2 ; the next row (23,0): the second line, CONGRATULATIONS!
$AEEA c GameOverWait ; the end of a won or lost game
> LD A,$FA; CALL $CCAC (the buzz; LD B,100; HALT; DJNZ (2 s; CALL WaitRelease; CALL WaitKey until a control is held; JP Start.
