> PrintInline bytes: attribute $17, position (0,22), size 0, " DAY:", newline, "TIME:", position (22,0), size $21 (2 rows high, 1 byte wide), attribute $05, "RADAR:", 0. White on red for the clock labels, cyan on black for RADAR:, neither BRIGHT. PrintInline returns past the 0 into ShowStatusPanel: DrawPlayScreen has no RET of its own.
