$D334 ; the same third...
$D335 ; ... H back by 8
$D337 ; (line 0 of the next character row)
$D338 ; HL = one line down
$D339 c PrevScreenLine ; DE = the screen address one pixel line up
> The reverse of NextScreenLine on DE: used only by DrawMaskedUp, which draws from the bottom line up. Keeps everything but A and the flags.
